Band Visual & Press Photoshoot Prompt: A maximalist, surreal image: The Umbra Rhapsody on a pristine, sun-drenched beach, caught in the sudden, eerie twilight of a total solar eclipse. Solaris Xylo, with a glowing, intricate feather and circuit board headdress, is mid-scream into a microphone draped with luminescent fronds, sweat glistening on their geometric face paint. Phaser Palm, adorned in reflective, iridescent fabrics, contorts over a glowing, modular TB-303, their bare feet furiously working its controls, while a kaleidoscope of percussive instruments (gleaming steel drums, obsidian congas, shimmering gourd shakers) explode around them. The sky is a dramatic deep violet-orange gradient, revealing the sun's ethereal corona, casting long, distorted shadows of palm trees. Over-saturated, vibrant colors clash with the sudden gloom, creating a sense of ecstatic disorientation and primal energy.

Mood or Vibe: Ecstatic disorientation, tropical-pagan euphoria, primal celebration in the face of cosmic awe.

